<title>USA: Newport Corp sets increase in shr buyback.</title>
<headline>Newport Corp sets increase in shr buyback.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newport Corp said on Friday its board had approved an additional 200,000 shares for repurchase under a share buyback program initiated in April.</p>
<p>This brings the total number of shares authorized for repurchase to 290,000 under the program, of which 76,000 have been repurchased to date, the company said.</p>
<p>It said the shares will be used for its stock option, restricted stock and employee stock purchase plans.</p>
<p>Newport had 8.9 million shares in common stock outstanding as of March 31.</p>
</text>
